### Variables
@apiKey = your-api-key-here
@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api
@cosmosEndpoint = https://your-cosmos-account.documents.azure.com:443/
@cosmosDatabase = your-database-name
@cosmosContainer = your-container-name
@openaiEndpoint = https://your-openai-resource.openai.azure.com/
@openaiKey = your-openai-key-here
@embeddingDeployment = text-embedding-ada-002
@blobEndpoint = https://your-storage-account.blob.core.windows.net
@aiSearchEndpoint = https://your-aisearch-resource.search.windows.net/indexes/your-index-name/docs/search?api-version=2025-08-01-preview
@aiSearchApiKey = your-aisearch-api-key-here
@aiSearchVectorFields = vector1,vector2
@acuEndpoint = https://your-acu-resource.cognitiveservices.azure.com/contentunderstanding/analyzers/your-analyzer:analyze?api-version=2025-09-01
@acuKey = your-acu-key-here
@operationLocation = https://your-acu-resource.cognitiveservices.azure.com/contentunderstanding/analyzers/your-analyzer/operations/your-operation-id?api-version=2025-09-01

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Search CosmosDB - Basic Search (Default top=10, Required select_fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search_cosmosdb?cosmos_endpoint={{cosmosEndpoint}}&cosmos_database={{cosmosDatabase}}&cosmos_container={{cosmosContainer}}&openai_endpoint={{openaiEndpoint}}&openai_key={{openaiKey}}&openai_embedding_deployment={{embeddingDeployment}}&select_fields=fileName,pageLink,pageNumber,pageContent
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "What is the project timeline?",
    "When is the project deadline?",
    "What are the key milestones?"
  ]
}

### Search CosmosDB - Custom Top Value (top=5)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search_cosmosdb?cosmos_endpoint={{cosmosEndpoint}}&cosmos_database={{cosmosDatabase}}&cosmos_container={{cosmosContainer}}&openai_endpoint={{openaiEndpoint}}&openai_key={{openaiKey}}&openai_embedding_deployment={{embeddingDeployment}}&top=5&select_fields=fileName,pageLink,pageNumber,pageContent
