### Extract Content - Basic Document (Default polling settings)
# New job mode: requires acu_endpoint and base64 content in JSON body
POST {{baseUrl}}/extract_content?acu_endpoint={{acuEndpoint}}&acu_key={{acuKey}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "BASE64_ENCODED_DOCUMENT_CONTENT_HERE",
  "content-type": "application/pdf"
}

### Extract Content - With Custom Polling Settings
POST {{baseUrl}}/extract_content?acu_endpoint={{acuEndpoint}}&acu_key={{acuKey}}&polling_timeout=600&polling_interval=3
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "BASE64_ENCODED_DOCUMENT_CONTENT_HERE",
  "content-type": "application/pdf"
}

### Extract Content - Using Header Authentication
POST {{baseUrl}}/extract_content?acu_endpoint={{acuEndpoint}}&polling_timeout=300&polling_interval=2
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-ACU-Key: {{acuKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "BASE64_ENCODED_IMAGE_CONTENT_HERE",
  "content-type": "image/png"
}

