### Extract Content - Large Document with Extended Timeout
POST {{baseUrl}}/extract_content?acu_endpoint={{acuEndpoint}}&acu_key={{acuKey}}&polling_timeout=900&polling_interval=5&min_chunk_size=15000
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
